ay Concern:<br/><br/>It is my pleasure to write this letter of recommendation for Ms. Angela Weston. Ms. Weston has worked over the past two years as an event coordinator and liaison officer at the Cambridge Community Center.  She is a motivated and responsible young woman.  If you offer her a position as a journalist, I am certain that she will prove to be a positive addition to your institution.", "time": "100", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le15ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "You may want to learn more about her background in communications. You could take a look at her portfolio. It is very impressive! You should ask her questions about world events. You will see that she is very intelligent and knowledgeable.  Are you looking for someone who can multitask? You should definitely consider her resum\u00e9.", "time": "25000", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le15ob07re2img03.jpg"}, {"text": "Ms. Weston will take the initiative to identify problems and devise solutions if she has the opportunity. It would be a good idea to let her cover business news.  You might want to encourage her in this direction. <br/><br/>If you require any further information about Ms. Weston, I suggest you contact me directly. <br/><br/>Sincerely,<br/>\nAlbert Toberman", "time": "46000", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le15ob07re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le15ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le15ob07re2img01.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}